<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's TCV to hold bond tender on Monday.</title>
<headline>Australia's TCV to hold bond tender on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said it will hold a bond tender at 10.30 a.m. local time (0030 GMT) on Monday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue will be announced at 10.00 a.m. (2400 GMT).</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
